name:          hharness-agent
version:       0.1.0.0
synopsis:
  Haskell agent loop library with Anthropic and OpenAI bridges

description:
  A library for building LLM-powered agentic applications.
  Provides a two-level API: a pure agent loop (HHAgent.AgentLoop)
  and a stateful Agent wrapper (HHAgent.Agent).
  HHAgent.Claude connects the loop to Anthropic via Mercury's @claude@ package.
  .
  Evolved from the TypeScript @mariozechner/pi-agent-core package.

license:       MIT
build-type:    Simple

